    <article className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-[#101827] p-5"><p className="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-300">04 · Learn the status</p><h3 className="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-white">Supported / Conditional / Review required</h3><ul className="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300"><li><b className="text-emerald-300">Supported:</b> stated rule prakaram supported; exact environment still validate cheyyali.</li><li><b className="text-amber-300">Conditional:</b> extra configuration, feature or version conditions apply.</li><li><b className="text-sky-300">Review required:</b> enough verified evidence ledu; official source check cheyyali.</li><li><b className="text-rose-300">Not supported:</b> documented constraint violate avuthondi.</li></ul></article>
